-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Chuckie Egg
  Publisher   A'n'F, 1983
  Version     1.1

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Chuckie Egg (1983)(A'n'F)[a3][a3].z80
  MD5         cddc0cfea8259d0c497b50fae0acd27e

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Harry gets a brown hat, skin and a blue-and-white outfit; the
              hens and the caged duck turn bright yellow. Source: enhanced
              colours from an older Spec256 conversion (the MVV package),
              painter not established.

  Changes     1.1: works on NextZXOS v2.10 (System/Next 26.11)

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Infinite bonus
   3  Infinite time
   4  Very slow big bird
   5  Big bird doesn't exist
   6  Slower hens
   7  No hens

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

